WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A conversation begins. One person asks for directions.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A door crosses the scene. For a moment, you cannot see the speaker.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Another person takes their place. Some observers continue the conversation.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
In a 1998 experiment, about half noticed. That's a study result, not a universal rule.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Noticing a change requires comparison across time.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
This doesn't prove meditation audio can change your brain. Follow evidence, not promises.
